{"id":55779,"ord":6,"n_segments":127,"prev":55778,"next":55780,"doc":{"id":"68097","title":"68097_Freddie Green oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Freddie Green","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/68097/","url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=68097"},"chapter":"Charleston childhood","title":"Burying his mother and marrying in Charleston","category":"family_childhood","summary":"Flashing forward, he says he went back when his mother died at eighteen or nineteen, and married there.","period":"c. 1930","year_from":1930,"year_to":1930,"words":171,"start":[10,17],"end":[12,6],"url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=68097#s55779","tags":{"places":[{"name":"Charleston","focus":1,"type":"city"},{"name":"New York","focus":0,"type":"city"}],"venues":[],"bands":[]},"people":[],"story":{"theme":43,"theme_name":"Meeting, marrying and raising a family","community":84,"community_name":"Meeting, courting and marrying: musicians' love lives","core":false},"blocks":[{"p":10,"b":17,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"No. Right."},{"p":10,"b":18,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"How much visiting did you ever do after that?"},{"p":10,"b":19,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Oh, I came back --"},{"p":11,"b":0,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Regularly?"},{"p":11,"b":1,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Periodically. Not too often."},{"p":11,"b":2,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"To stay with family or --"},{"p":11,"b":3,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"But, that's afterwards."},{"p":11,"b":4,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Yeah. After you had gone up?"},{"p":11,"b":5,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Yeah. After I had gone up and I went to school and everything in New York."},{"p":11,"b":6,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Yeah, I see."},{"p":11,"b":7,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"And then I went back because my mother died."},{"p":11,"b":8,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Oh. How old were you when your mother died."},{"p":11,"b":9,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"I was nineteen -- eighteen, nineteen."},{"p":11,"b":10,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"How did she die -- do you know?"},{"p":11,"b":11,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"No."},{"p":11,"b":12,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"No"},{"p":11,"b":13,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Eighteen or nineteen."},{"p":11,"b":14,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"But you were with her -- before she died?"},{"p":11,"b":15,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"No, I wasn't there."},{"p":11,"b":16,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Oh."},{"p":11,"b":17,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"No."},{"p":11,"b":18,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"In other words, Because I couldn't get back."},{"p":11,"b":19,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Yeah."},{"p":11,"b":20,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"You know."},{"p":11,"b":21,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Yeah. You didn't know in time or you couldn't reach them?"},{"p":12,"b":0,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"And then I came back to New York, uh, to bury her, in other words. And I stayed down."},{"p":12,"b":1,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Well?"},{"p":12,"b":2,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Then I got married after that"},{"p":12,"b":3,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Down there?"},{"p":12,"b":4,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Down there."},{"p":12,"b":5,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Oh, you did. Well, alright -- we're going too fast."},{"p":12,"b":6,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Yeah. Oh."}]}